# How to fix everything — Vyomaraj (2026-09-29)

This package **diagnoses** both repos, then **updates the live site** and
**replicates to the DR repo**, with checks so it can never ship the wrong bytes
or overwrite diverged work.

## What is actually wrong (verified against GitHub)
| Repo | State |
|---|---|
| **PRIMARY** `Vyomaraj1356/Vyomarajai` | Public, reachable, **serves the live site**. `index.html` is still the **old 166,871-byte** page; `README.md` was wiped to **1 byte**. |
