## STEP 1 — Fix (updates the live site + DR) — 2 min
1. Install **Git for Windows**: https://git-scm.com/download/win
2. **Double-click `Vyomaraj-Fix-All.bat`** and sign in to GitHub when prompted.
3. It prints a **RESULT** and writes `vyomaraj-sync-ledger.json`.
4. ~1 minute later open https://Vyomaraj1356.github.io/Vyomarajai/ — you should
   see the **🌟 Vyomaraj Best** and **🏦 Banks & Payouts** tabs.

## What the fix script guarantees
- **md5 gate** — refuses to push unless `index.html` is exactly the verified page
  (`a233dcbb…`, 1,916,519 bytes). Wrong bytes → it stops.
- **No blind overwrite** — clones the current branch head, commits on top, pushes;
  a branch that moved underneath is rejected, never force-pushed.
- **Verifies the remote HEAD** after writing; writes a sync ledger.
- **Explicit failure states**: `AUTH_FAILURE`, `REPOSITORY_ACCESS_FAILURE`,
  `BRANCH_FAILURE`, `PUSH_FAILURE`, `SYNC_CONFLICT`, `SOURCE_MISMATCH`.

