## If the DR stays 404
Expected until your identity can reach the private DR. The fix reports
`PRIMARY=UPDATED  DR=STALE` — **the live site is still fixed.** Diagnose-only
(read-only) anytime: `bash vyomaraj-dual-sync.sh --diagnose`.
